# 설정 가이드

## 환경별 설정 구조
- `application.yml`: 공통 설정
- `application-dev.yml`: 개발환경  
- `application-prod.yml`: 운영환경
- `application-test.yml`: 테스트환경

## Kafka Streams 핵심 설정

### 기본 설정 (application.yml)
```yaml
spring:
  application:
    name: kafka-streams-app
  kafka:
    bootstrap-servers: ${KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS:localhost:9092}
    streams:
      application-id: ${STREAMS_APPLICATION_ID:kafka-streams-app}
      properties:
        # 성능 & 안정성
        processing.guarantee: exactly_once_v2
        num.stream.threads: ${STREAMS_THREADS:3}
        num.standby.replicas: ${STREAMS_STANDBY_REPLICAS:1}
        replication.factor: ${KAFKA_REPLICATION_FACTOR:3}
        
        # 메모리 & 상태 관리
        cache.max.bytes.buffering: ${STREAMS_CACHE_SIZE:33554432}  # 32MB
        commit.interval.ms: ${STREAMS_COMMIT_INTERVAL:30000}
        state.dir: ${STREAMS_STATE_DIR:/tmp/kafka-streams}
        
        # RocksDB 최적화
        rocksdb.config.setter: com.example.config.RocksDBConfig

# 환경변수 기본값
streams:
  topics:
    input: ${INPUT_TOPIC:input-events}
    output: ${OUTPUT_TOPIC:output-events}
    error: ${ERROR_TOPIC:error-events}
    dlq: ${DLQ_TOPIC:dead-letter-queue}
```

### Spring Boot 3.x 최적화
```yaml
spring:
  # Virtual Threads (3.2+)
  threads:
    virtual:
      enabled: true
      
  # Native Compilation 지원
  aot:
    enabled: ${NATIVE_ENABLED:false}
    
  # JSON 설정 (Jackson)
  jackson:
    time-zone: UTC
    serialization:
      write-dates-as-timestamps: false
    deserialization:
      fail-on-unknown-properties: false

# Server 설정
server:
  port: ${SERVER_PORT:8080}
  shutdown: graceful
  
spring:
  lifecycle:
    timeout-per-shutdown-phase: 30s
```

## Type-Safe Configuration Properties

### Java 17 방식
```java
@ConfigurationProperties(prefix = "streams")
public record StreamsProperties(
    TopicsConfig topics,
    ProcessingConfig processing,
    MonitoringConfig monitoring
) {
    public record TopicsConfig(
        String input,
        String output,
        String error,
        String dlq
    ) {}
    
    public record ProcessingConfig(
        int threads,
        int standbyReplicas,
        Duration commitInterval,
        DataSize cacheSize
    ) {}
    
    public record MonitoringConfig(
        boolean enabled,
        Duration metricsInterval
    ) {}
}
```

### Kotlin 방식
```kotlin
@ConfigurationProperties(prefix = "streams")
data class StreamsProperties(
    val topics: TopicsConfig,
    val processing: ProcessingConfig,
    val monitoring: MonitoringConfig = MonitoringConfig()
) {
    data class TopicsConfig(
        val input: String,
        val output: String,
        val error: String,
        val dlq: String
    )
    
    data class ProcessingConfig(
        val threads: Int = 3,
        val standbyReplicas: Int = 1,
        val commitInterval: Duration = Duration.ofSeconds(30),
        val cacheSize: DataSize = DataSize.ofMegabytes(32)
    )
    
    data class MonitoringConfig(
        val enabled: Boolean = true,
        val metricsInterval: Duration = Duration.ofSeconds(30)
    )
}
```

## 환경별 설정 최적화

### 개발환경 (application-dev.yml)
```yaml
spring:
  kafka:
    streams:
      properties:
        num.stream.threads: 1
        num.standby.replicas: 0  # 개발에서는 불필요
        cache.max.bytes.buffering: 10485760  # 10MB (적게)

logging:
  level:
    com.example: DEBUG
    org.apache.kafka.streams: DEBUG
    org.springframework.kafka: DEBUG
```

### 운영환경 (application-prod.yml)
```yaml
spring:
  kafka:
    streams:
      properties:
        num.stream.threads: ${STREAMS_THREADS:6}
        num.standby.replicas: 2  # 고가용성
        cache.max.bytes.buffering: 67108864  # 64MB
        
        # 운영 최적화
        topology.optimization: all
        max.task.idle.ms: 100
        
management:
  endpoints:
    web:
      exposure:
        include: health,metrics,streams,info
  metrics:
    export:
      prometheus:
        enabled: true
        step: 30s

logging:
  level:
    com.example: INFO
    org.apache.kafka: WARN
    root: WARN
  file:
    name: /var/log/kafka-streams/application.log
```

### 테스트환경 (application-test.yml)
```yaml
spring:
  kafka:
    streams:
      properties:
        num.stream.threads: 1
        processing.guarantee: at_least_once  # 테스트용
        state.dir: /tmp/test-streams
        
logging:
  level:
    org.apache.kafka: WARN
    com.example: DEBUG
```

## 모니터링 & 액추에이터 설정

### Actuator 설정
```yaml
management:
  endpoints:
    web:
      exposure:
        include: health,metrics,streams,info,prometheus
      base-path: /actuator
  endpoint:
    health:
      show-details: always
      show-components: always
    streams:
      enabled: true
    metrics:
      enabled: true
      
  health:
    kafka:
      enabled: true
    diskspace:
      enabled: true
      
  metrics:
    tags:
      application: ${spring.application.name}
      environment: ${spring.profiles.active}
    export:
      prometheus:
        enabled: ${METRICS_ENABLED:true}
        step: ${METRICS_INTERVAL:30s}
```

### Custom Health Indicator
```java
@Component
public class StreamsHealthIndicator implements HealthIndicator {
    
    private final KafkaStreams kafkaStreams;
    
    @Override
    public Health health() {
        var state = kafkaStreams.state();
        return switch (state) {
            case RUNNING -> Health.up()
                .withDetail("state", state.name())
                .withDetail("threads", getThreadInfo())
                .build();
            case REBALANCING -> Health.up()
                .withDetail("state", "REBALANCING")
                .build();
            case ERROR -> Health.down()
                .withDetail("state", "ERROR")
                .build();
            default -> Health.unknown()
                .withDetail("state", state.name())
                .build();
        };
    }
}
```

## 로깅 설정

### Logback 구조화 로깅
```yaml
logging:
  pattern:
    console: "%clr(%d{HH:mm:ss.SSS}){faint} %clr(${LOG_LEVEL_PATTERN:-%5p}) %clr(${PID:- }){magenta} %clr(---){faint} %clr([%15.15t]){faint} %clr(%-40.40logger{39}){cyan} %clr(:){faint} %m%n${LOG_EXCEPTION_CONVERSION_WORD:-%wEx}"
    file: "%d{yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss.SSS} [%thread] %-5level %logger{36} - %msg%n"
    
  level:
    org.apache.kafka.streams: ${KAFKA_STREAMS_LOG_LEVEL:INFO}
    org.apache.kafka.clients: ${KAFKA_CLIENTS_LOG_LEVEL:WARN}
    com.example: ${APP_LOG_LEVEL:INFO}
    
  file:
    name: ${LOG_FILE_PATH:logs/${spring.application.name}.log}
    max-size: ${LOG_FILE_MAX_SIZE:100MB}
    max-history: ${LOG_FILE_MAX_HISTORY:7}
```

## 보안 설정

### SASL/SSL 설정 (운영환경)
```yaml
spring:
  kafka:
    security:
      protocol: SASL_SSL
    sasl:
      mechanism: SCRAM-SHA-256
      jaas:
        config: org.apache.kafka.common.security.scram.ScramLoginModule required username="${KAFKA_USERNAME}" password="${KAFKA_PASSWORD}";
    ssl:
      trust-store-location: ${KAFKA_TRUSTSTORE_PATH}
      trust-store-password: ${KAFKA_TRUSTSTORE_PASSWORD}
      key-store-location: ${KAFKA_KEYSTORE_PATH}
      key-store-password: ${KAFKA_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD}
```

## 환경변수 가이드

### 필수 환경변수
```bash
# Kafka 연결
KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS=kafka-broker-1:9092,kafka-broker-2:9092
STREAMS_APPLICATION_ID=my-streams-app

# 성능 튜닝
STREAMS_THREADS=6
STREAMS_STANDBY_REPLICAS=1
STREAMS_CACHE_SIZE=67108864

# 상태 저장소
STREAMS_STATE_DIR=/opt/kafka-streams/state

# 모니터링
METRICS_ENABLED=true
METRICS_INTERVAL=30s

# 보안 (운영환경)
KAFKA_USERNAME=streams-user
KAFKA_PASSWORD=secure-password
```

### 개발용 .env 파일
```bash
# 개발환경 기본값
KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS=localhost:9092
STREAMS_APPLICATION_ID=dev-streams-app
STREAMS_THREADS=2
APP_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
METRICS_ENABLED=false
```

## Docker Compose 통합

### docker-compose.yml 환경변수 매핑
```yaml
services:
  kafka-streams-app:
    image: kafka-streams-app:latest
    environment:
      KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS: kafka:29092
      STREAMS_APPLICATION_ID: docker-streams-app
      STREAMS_STATE_DIR: /app/state
      SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE: docker
    volumes:
      - streams-state:/app/state
    depends_on:
      - kafka

volumes:
  streams-state:
```